rows.text:
Exigere is the technical term for
                making weights and measures correspond with the standards in charge of the aediles;
                see C.I.L. XIV. 4124. 1,2; X. 8067. 2; etc.

That is, grapes
                  suited for eating and not for making wine; cf. Mart. 13. 22>;
                    Colum. 3. 2.

Because of its resemblance to non is (from eo); cf. Cic. de Div. 284;
                or perhaps merely because it contained
              non.
